{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30171","headline":"华山南望春 · 朱景玄","name":"华山南望春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵岳多异状，巉巉出虚空。\n闲云恋岩壑，起灭苍翠中。\n皓气澄野水，神光秘琼宫。\n鹤巢前林雪，瀑落满涧风。\n春尽花未发，川回路难穷。\n何因着山屐，鹿迹寻羊公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱景玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}